{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/unregisterforpushnotifications:"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" (^","kind":"text"},{"text":")(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","text":"NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Block called when unregistration completes.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Receives nil on success or an NSError on failure.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes the device from receiving push notifications:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Notifies Pushwoosh servers to stop sending notifications to this device"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Removes the device token from Pushwoosh","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this when the user logs out, deletes their account, or explicitly disables notifications.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unregister during user logout:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class AuthenticationManager {","","    func logout(completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","        \/\/ Show loading indicator","        LoadingIndicator.show()","","        \/\/ First, unregister from push to stop receiving notifications for this user","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { [weak self] error in","            if let error = error {","                Logger.warning(\"Push unregistration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","                \/\/ Continue with logout even if unregistration fails","            }","","            \/\/ Clear user session","            self?.clearUserSession()","","            \/\/ Clear user tags","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                \"logged_in\": false,","                \"user_id\": NSNull(),","                \"email\": NSNull()","            ])","","            \/\/ Stop server communication if required by privacy policy","            if UserDefaults.standard.bool(forKey: \"clearDataOnLogout\") {","                Pushwoosh.configure.stopServerCommunication()","            }","","            LoadingIndicator.hide()","            completion(.success(()))","        }","    }","","    private func clearUserSession() {","        KeychainManager.shared.clearCredentials()","        UserDefaults.standard.removePersistentDomain(forName: Bundle.main.bundleIdentifier!)","        CoreDataManager.shared.clearUserData()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:"}],"title":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)unregisterForPushNotifications:","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Unregisters the device from push notifications.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/unregisterForPushNotifications:"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/unregisterForPushNotifications:":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/unregisterforpushnotifications:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/unregisterForPushNotifications:","abstract":[{"text":"Unregisters the device from push notifications.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol"}}}